  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA distributed value fell 4.7% over 30D:</strong> On-chain RWA distributed value at $14.28B (4.7% lower over 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/11/04/tokenization-and-stablecoins-may-weather-democrats-sweep-as-broader-crypto-rules-face-uncertainty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tokenization and stablecoins may weather Democrats&#x27; sweep as broader crypto rules face uncertainty</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/soci-t-g-n-rale-accepts-10-million-in-dtcc-tokenized-treasuries-as-collateral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 G\u00e9n\u00e9rale Accepts $10 Million in DTCC-Tokenized Treasuries as Collateral</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Tokenized T-bill supply is still expanding through new products:</strong> That usually shows up first as new issuer and product supply, then as higher distributed value and denser collateral-style use across networks and platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/11/05/ukraine-s-central-bank-opposes-crypto-bill-citing-monetary-sovereignty-concerns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ukraine\u2019s central bank opposes crypto bill, citing monetary sovereignty concerns</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/11/05/binance-cuts-signalplus-access-after-security-warning-urges-users-to-check-accounts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Binance cuts SignalPlus access after security warning, urges users to check accounts</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
